[Music]  are you putting your greasy fingers all  over your keyboard and screen ever find  a snack in between those keys thank you  don't have dirt think again do you just  turn to household cleaning supplies to  clean up the mess  don't instead you should try my  revolutionary gadget cleaning program  okay  I'm not the ShamWow guy but your gadgets  are gross so here's my advice for  cleaning your phone tablet and computer  no monthly installments completely free  though you do have to buy some cleaning  supplies first before you even roll up  your sleeves and put on the gloves  unplug your devices and power them off  now let's begin with removing the  fingerprints and other schmutz from the  screen stay away from wind acts soft  scrub and any other cleaning supplies  that have ammonia or are abrasive and  don't use paper towels they'll leave  lint scratches or big streaks instead  buy a microfiber cloth like this one  from iclear that has a terry cloth feel  the flatter ones like this one called  the eye cloth don't absorb liquids as  well  microfiber alone will clean the screen  but not as well as dampening it with  some water or some screen cleaners don't  ever apply the spray directly to the  screen now what spray to use is the big  question now there are lots of screen  cleaning solutions and I tested a lot of  them and they work really well they  leave no streaks on the screen but I  found that a homemade solution of water  and a bit of isopropyl alcohol did just  as well the catch there is is that you  have to put it in a misting spray bottle  to evenly apply it to the cloth of the  commercial cleaners I did like I clears  kit the best because of the included  microfiber cloth and the solution  doesn't have a strong of an odor as the  others you can also use these to clean  the exterior of your phone computer or  tablet I prefer to eye clear and zag  though to the water-based solutions they  were just easier to clean off the  surfaces when you get to cleaning  remember to clean around the trackpad  and other small areas you might not see  the dirt in regular light but this UV  light reveals all now it's time to talk  about your chrome covered oily mess of a  keyboard  my first revolutionary trick tipping it  over then a can of compressed air is  still the best way to get the [ __ ] out  of the tighter areas of your keyboard  I did try more eco-friendly and  economical options but this Canlas  electronic option didn't have as much  power to blow away those stubborn little  pieces of dirt and this battery-powered  vacuum was a total wimp now grab that  damp microfiber cloth again and wash  down those keys  I also liked this $5 Good Grips  electronic cleaning brush it's got a  nice little brush here on the end and  you can sweep through the keys and it's  good for getting into the ports though  you can pretty much also use a  toothbrush so there you have it a good  microfiber terry cloth and some water  and a misting spray bottle will go a  long way and i clear solution even just  for getting that microfiber cloth is  probably a worthy investment and when it  comes to cleaning that keyboard don't  forget the canned air and a small brush

